[hr][/hr]
Changelog ⤵️

General:

 Fixed an issue where high FPS could cause audio to break;
 Fixed an issue where characters could get stuck while climbing through open windows;
 Fixed an issue when hosting or joining a game with player names containing special characters like `:` or `\\%`;
 Fixed an issue where a hero would start climbing a ladder while aiming simultaneously;
 Fixed an issue where, after killing a stunned enemy, the stun icon would reappear over the dead body following a save and full load;
 Fixed an issue with picking up collectibles while in a prone position;
 Improved handling of stacked keys to prevent rare softlocks;
 Tweaked vehicle behavior after save/load sequences to ensure proper movement;
 Added a feature to limit FPS when the app is out of focus;
 Adjusted the visibility of online games on Steam;
 Trading cards are available.

Chapter I:

 Patrol squads will now follow their routes, even if tutorials are turned off mid-level.

Chapter III:

 The tank and commander will no longer get stuck. Both will now complete their movement orders correctly, and the commander will always reach the regroup point;
 Fixed ledges to prevent Heniu from getting trapped;
 The executioner squad will no longer be triggered by the sound of Youngster running in uniform.

Chapter V:

 Fixed an issue where tags were not cleared from Helga's wounded partisans, ensuring they follow orders correctly;
 The "Defeat enemies" quest will no longer reset after a full load.

[hr][/hr]
INFO REGARDING PRIOR SAVES ⚠️

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38629372/cfb548fc2bd9173a82b5f4a42e640eeb3829bd5e.jpg
Reminder: we’ve added a new public branch named ‘previous_build’ for 63 Days, which allows you to play the last game version, pre-patched. If you want to continue the game from a saved game state, please switch over to that branch, finish your current chapter, switch back to the ‘default’ branch and continue the journey with the latest fixes.

How:

    Select the game from your Steam game library (not the store page);
    Click with the right mouse button on 63 Days and select ‘properties’;

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44969737/eef420c27122e4ca0e2ccae08e54ba89446713e1.png

    In the settings, move to the right side or down – depending on your Steam version: Properties -> Beta -> Select Beta version, and choose the desired version.

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44969737/44c39ea8b7855821157fdd06b885ae50147c628a.png

It will update the game (rollback to the previous version) of the game.

